 for a previous Train Sim World\u00ae - features may remain unchanged from the original release and may not make use of all newer core features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With any upgrades from a previous Train Sim World \u2013 your content comes with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please Note: The Train Sim World 5 UI is localised into English, French, German, Spanish, Italian, Polish, Russian, and Simplified Chinese. Localisation on Add-On content varies depending on the individual content.</p>",
